 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_5e675b280ac9d280c8db",
   "sourceHash": "5e675b280ac9d280c8dbce509de9f29799cead13e206c955c6a6214a445e42dc",
   "text": "学院既提供短期课程，也提供长期实践培训项目，面向初学者以及希望提升知识与技能的阿育吠陀讲师。我们的目的不仅是传授信息，更是让学员了解我们以健康为最终目标的历史根源。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_01bfae8fc118954fcfdf",
   "sourceHash": "01bfae8fc118954fcfdf47d1b564de49266f61d58eba3680c43eb3a245c467d5",
   "text": "学院很荣幸曾为来自印度、德国、日本、西班牙、法国和澳大利亚的理疗师及阿育吠陀专业人士提供培训。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_da48ff7a07086c38c049",
   "sourceHash": "da48ff7a07086c38c049e00a6f5a6e7172b8d160daa61afe87a627b62850b92f",
   "text": "2009 年，Kairali 开启了一项新事业——为潘查卡玛理疗师提供高质量培训。自那时起，Kairali 已在喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德的阿育吠陀疗愈村及其位于德里的阿育吠陀中心，为来自德国、日本、西班牙、法国和澳大利亚等世界各地的众多学员提供了培训。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9293532d0485157cea2e",
   "sourceHash": "9293532d0485157cea2e079b668e2c249dec650651415dfc16932a945ff5d6c4",
   "text": "这项事业的巨大成功，在培养高素质人才、满足全球乃至机构内部对优质理疗师日益增长的需求方面发挥了非常重要的作用！Kairali 决定更进一步，创办自己的培训学院，从而确保成功满足“全球”对专业人才的需求，并通过为每位理疗师颁发文凭，让服务使用者更加放心。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0195506961943ec4cfde",
   "sourceHash": "0195506961943ec4cfde668a5262fe2c17023685f163f7c401f3d1a30eaad1df",
   "text": "此前，Kairali 仅提供简短的入门培训项目，面向有兴趣学习阿育吠陀最基础知识的人士。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1c7195813eeadde88dca",
   "sourceHash": "1c7195813eeadde88dca93eeecd046f247c7d948e7b01cdd965437b8a927ef3a",
   "text": "这些课程目前仍在“阿育吠陀疗愈村”开设。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_df2d19640c001926db22",
   "sourceHash": "df2d19640c001926db2298b63956568399a918c5721ad28b35283dcc35ea1147",
   "text": "喀拉拉邦专属阿育吠陀康养中心 – Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Wellness Retreat' rendered as 康养中心 (care centre) to avoid resort/holiday framing under the clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7c28d8d711380b3e948f",
   "sourceHash": "7c28d8d711380b3e948ff11dc6abb6067a61310c5341061cf986f1ea89114e00",
   "text": "在 Kairali 体验高品质阿育吠陀康养——这里是喀拉拉邦享誉全球的健康目的地，提供正宗的阿育吠陀疗愈与整体身心调理。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'elite retreat' rendered as 高品质康养 and 'Indulge' as 体验 to avoid luxury/resort framing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e258bdeaff067069bae3",
   "sourceHash": "e258bdeaff067069bae38b0c5ea670fc9fdd350220d629a572299d8e751ad8a1",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_afc211baf9f974873756",
   "sourceHash": "afc211baf9f974873756a05fe0f85b8c343670b0a7a1eba46e910e64f8fa773c",
   "text": "传统瓦顶门楼，铁门通向一条两旁种满植物的林间小径",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9437dd0402985aef5dd0",
   "sourceHash": "9437dd0402985aef5dd01723b50a23c9529c109bc9fdaf337238841fe06d4e12",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村坐落于喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德宁静的自然风光之中，是一家享誉世界的健康中心，专注于正宗的阿育吠陀治疗、全面的身心调理和生态友好的生活方式。作为 Kairali Ayurvedic Group 旗下的首要疗养机构，这片宁静之地将 5,000 年的阿育吠陀智慧与现代接待服务自然融合，为您提供一条通往健康、和谐与内心安宁的蜕变之路。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'premier retreat' rendered as 首要疗养机构 to avoid resort framing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_863250ef7dcaab63d6af",
   "sourceHash": "863250ef7dcaab63d6afd26f8cd82e50a7bc21ceb68c845957c356b0bf249c89",
   "text": "享誉全球的健康目的地",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8c9d53d0a69e5c1a0d6e",
   "sourceHash": "8c9d53d0a69e5c1a0d6ed45e53892c40c0ab66815f2c8e68b37790e3c575af0d",
   "text": "Kairali 的阿育吠陀疗愈村已",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_072eb2ef02107056163d",
   "sourceHash": "072eb2ef02107056163d4a93f6dae927cc83f8c87ab95c9ec5d77e97c689d24d",
